(c) 247 binary words of length <= 7 realised as rational T-cycles (word recovered exactly); integer cycles found: [(-1,), (1, 2), (-10, -7, -5)]
(d) doubling orbit of 2/3: [Fraction(2, 3), Fraction(1, 3), Fraction(2, 3), Fraction(1, 3)] ; of 4/7 = rho(1/5) (period 3, word 100 -> x0 = 1/5; rho(4/5) = 1/7, rho(2/5) = 2/7): [Fraction(4, 7), Fraction(1, 7), Fraction(2, 7), Fraction(4, 7)]
